data/

# Root-level drift report output (scripts/generate_drift_report.py) — CI
# generates this fresh each run and ships it to the VPS; only the notebook's
# own committed snapshot under notebooks/reports/ is tracked. Anchored to the
# repo root so it doesn't also match notebooks/reports/.
/reports/

